  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: FOCUS Column Handling > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L007: \"Column conforming to FocusColumnHandling attribute MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"[*FOCUS column*](#glossary:FOCUS-column) MUST use a Display Name consistent with the Column ID, with spaces inserted between words (e.g., Column ID `BillingAccountName` and Display Name `Billing Account Name`, Column ID `BillingAccountId` and Display Name `Billing Account ID`).\"",
    "  L010: \"*FOCUS column* MUST use [*Pascal case*](#glossary:pascalcase) in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L011: \"*FOCUS column* MUST use only alphanumeric characters in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L012: \"*FOCUS column* MUST NOT include special characters in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L013: \"*FOCUS column* MUST NOT use abbreviations other than `Id` in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L014: \"*FOCUS column* SHOULD NOT use acronyms other than `Sku` in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L015: \"*FOCUS column* SHOULD NOT exceed 50 characters in the Column ID to accommodate column length restrictions of various data repositories.\"",
    "  L016: \"*FOCUS column* representing an identifier MUST include the `Id` suffix in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L017: \"*FOCUS column* representing a name MUST include the `Name` suffix in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L018: \"*FOCUS column* representing a product offering that incurred a charge MUST include `Sku` in the Column ID.\"",
    "  L019: \"*FOCUS column* that includes the `Category` suffix in the Column ID and is not null MUST contain one of the FOCUS-defined allowed values.\""
  ],
